OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after fireworks set
OL,4,Aoff on roof
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after
OL,7,Ffireworks were set off on a roof in
OL,8,FBirmingham.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Dale End while
OL,11,Fthey were patrolling the city centre
OL,12,Fthroughout Friday night and Saturday
OL,13,Fmorning, West Midlands Police said.
OL,15,FThe force used drones to search the
OL,16,Farea before the men, aged 26 and 28,
OL,17,Fwere detained on suspicion of illegally
OL,18,Fthrowing fireworks in a public place.
OL,20,FBoth of them remained in custody for
OL,21,Fquestioning, the police spokesperson
OL,22,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
